@startuml
!theme vibrant
title MedShare Sequence: Federated Round Execution

actor "Hospital Node" as NODE
participant "Flower Client" as CLIENT
participant "PyTorch Model" as MODEL
participant "Opacus Engine" as PRIVACY
database "Local Data" as DATA
participant "Blockchain Service" as CHAIN
participant "Smart Contract" as CONTRACT
participant "Aggregation Server" as SERVER
participant "Strategy (Defense)" as STRAT

== Initialization ==
SERVER -> CLIENT : Request Initial Parameters
CLIENT -> MODEL : get_parameters()
CLIENT --> SERVER : Return Random/Init Weights

== Training Round (Loop) ==
SERVER -> CLIENT : 1. fit(global_weights)
activate CLIENT

CLIENT -> MODEL : set_parameters(global_weights)
CLIENT -> DATA : Load Batch
CLIENT -> MODEL : Forward Pass
MODEL -> PRIVACY : Calculate Gradients (Clipped)
PRIVACY -> PRIVACY : Add Gaussian Noise (sigma=1.0)
PRIVACY --> MODEL : Update Weights (Backprop)

CLIENT -> CHAIN : Hash & Sign(New Weights)
activate CHAIN
CHAIN -> CONTRACT : postCommitment(round, hash)
CONTRACT --> CHAIN : Transaction Receipt (Gas Used)
CHAIN --> CLIENT : Return tx_hash
deactivate CHAIN

CLIENT --> SERVER : Return (New Weights, num_samples, tx_hash)
deactivate CLIENT

== Aggregation Phase ==
SERVER -> STRAT : aggregate_fit(results)
activate STRAT

STRAT -> STRAT : Calculate Norms
STRAT -> STRAT : Robust-MAD Defense
note right: "Drops malicious updates (e.g. Robust-MAD)"

STRAT -> CHAIN : postFinalModel(global_hash)
CHAIN -> CONTRACT : Log Final Round Hash
STRAT --> SERVER : Return Aggregated Global Model
deactivate STRAT

== Evaluation ==
SERVER -> CLIENT : evaluate(new_global_model)
CLIENT -> DATA : Test on Holdout Set (Validation)
CLIENT -> MODEL : accuracy_score()
CLIENT --> SERVER : Return (Accuracy, Loss)

@enduml
